'''''Misopates calycinum''''' is a species of annual herb in the family [[Plantaginaceae]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Misopates calycinum (Lange) Rothm. {{!}} Plants of the World Online {{!}} Kew Science |url=http://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:806146-1 |access-date=2022-06-03 |website=Plants of the World Online |language=en}}</ref> They have simple leaves.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Misopates calycinum (Vent.) Rothm. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/5673924|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Misopates calycinum (Pale Lesser Snapdragon) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/PLNT/Misopates_calycinum.php |access-date=2022-03-05 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

